  "content": "<h1>Eyelib</h1><p>為 <em>Minecraft</em> 打造的渲染器函式庫。</p><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/maven-central/v/io.github.tt432/eyelib\" alt=\"Maven Central 版本\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeepwiki.com%252fTT432%252feyelib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg\" alt=\"詢問 DeepWiki\"></a></p><h2>開始使用</h2><p>本函式庫已發佈至 Maven Central。</p><pre><code>dependencies {\n    implementation \"io.github.tt432:eyelib:${eyelib_version}\"\n}</code></pre><p>或者，您可以使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.cursemaven.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseMaven</a>。</p><h2>相依項目</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TT432/antlr-molang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antlr-Molang</a> 用於解析 Molang。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/dmlloyd/jdk-classfile-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jdk-classfile-backport</a> 用於為 Molang 生成位元組碼。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojectlombok.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lombok</a> 用於生成 getter/setter 及其他功能。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TT432/chin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chin</a> 用於工具函式。</li>\n</ul>",
